"size": [383.9332275390625, 198.0321807861328], "pos": [1235.775634765625, 2016.9599609375], "id": 50, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["太棒了，这是一个非常经典且充满发挥空间的题材。为了呈现好莱坞级别的浪漫质感，我将把这1分钟的视频设计为一部微电影，利用光影的变化（从午后暖阳到夜晚的城市霓虹）来推进情感的升温。\n\n这里是为您定制的《城市微光与你》Sora 2 分镜头脚本。\n\n***\n\n# 🎬 影片概览\n\n*   **影片主题:** 城市微光与你 (Urban Starlight & You)\n*   **总时长:** 60 秒 (包含 4 个 15秒片段)\n*   **风格基调:** 王家卫式浪漫 / 唯美日系 / 温暖光影 / 8K 电影质感\n*   **主角设定:**\n    *   男主角: **@otkdavhcb.harustrate** (文中简称 Haru，设定为温文尔雅，穿着时尚风衣)\n    *   女主角: **@gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow** (文中简称 Sayuri，设定为清纯灵动，穿着浅色针织衫)\n\n---\n\n# 📼 Segment 1 (00:00 - 00:15)\n**本段主题：期待与初见 (午后 4:00 PM)**\n**本段总时长：15.0秒**\n\n### Shot 1\n*   **Duration:** 4.5 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** Haru 在充满艺术气息的街角等待，神情略带紧张又期待。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Sora video of @otkdavhcb.harustrate standing on a charming European-style cobblestone street corner during late afternoon. Soft sunlight filters through autumn leaves, casting dappled shadows on his face. He is wearing a stylish beige trench coat, checking his wristwatch nervously but smiling. Highly detailed skin texture, cinematic lighting, photorealistic, 8k, anamorphic lens.\n*   **Camera:** Medium Shot (中景), 缓慢推近 (Slow Dolly In)\n*   **中文旁白:** “等待的时间，总是被心跳拉得很长。”\n\n### Shot 2\n*   **Duration:** 3.5 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** Sayuri 从人群中走来，回头的一瞬间，发丝飞舞。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Sora video of @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow walking through a blurred crowd. She turns her head towards the camera, smiling radiantly. She wears a soft white knit sweater. Golden hour backlighting creates a halo effect around her hair, wind gently blowing her hair strands. Slow motion, dreamy atmosphere, shallow depth of field, bokeh background.\n*   **Camera:** Close-up (特写), 焦点跟随 (Rack Focus)\n*   **中文旁白:** “直到看见你的那一刻，世界突然安静了。”\n\n### Shot 3\n*   **Duration:** 3.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 两人的视线交汇，Haru 露出温柔的笑容。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Close-up of @otkdavhcb.harustrate's eyes lighting up with joy as he sees her. The background is a soft blur of city colors. The expression is subtle but full of emotion. Warm color grading, Kodak Portra film aesthetic.\n*   **Camera:** Extreme Close-up (大特写), 静态镜头 (Static)\n*   **中文旁白:** “原来，你也在这里。”\n\n### Shot 4\n*   **Duration:** 4.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 两人并肩漫步在林荫道，虽然没有牵手，但距离很近。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Wide shot of @otkdavhcb.harustrate and @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow walking side by side down a tree-lined avenue. The sun is setting behind them, creating long shadows. Leaves are falling gently. They are talking and laughing naturally. Cinematic composition, rule of thirds.\n*   **Camera:** Tracking Shot (侧面跟拍), 稳定器运镜\n*   **中文旁白:** “我们的故事，从这个午后开始书写。”\n\n---\n\n# 📼 Segment 2 (00:15 - 00:30)\n**本段主题：共鸣与靠近 (黄昏 6:00 PM)**\n**本段总时长：15.0秒**\n\n### Shot 5\n*   **Duration:** 5.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 在一家复古咖啡馆内，两人隔桌对坐，分享甜点。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Interior shot of a cozy vintage cafe with warm ambient lighting. @otkdavhcb.harustrate and @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow are sitting across from each other at a small wooden table. Steam rises from coffee cups. Sayuri is laughing at something Haru said. Through the window, the sky is turning purple and orange. High contrast, moody lighting.\n*   **Camera:** Over-the-shoulder (过肩镜头), 聚焦在女主角脸上\n*   **中文旁白:** “咖啡的香气里，藏着我想对你说的秘密。”\n\n### Shot 6\n*   **Duration:** 4.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 桌面特写，两人的手放在桌上，手指轻轻触碰又缩回。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Macro shot of two hands on a wooden table near a coffee cup. @otkdavhcb.harustrate's hand gently brushes against @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow's fingers. The touch is tentative and electric. Dust motes dancing in the shaft of light. 8k resolution, intricate details.\n*   **Camera:** High angle (高角度), 微距 (Macro)\n*   **中文旁白:** “指尖的微温，胜过千言万语。”\n\n### Shot 7\n*   **Duration:** 6.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 两人走出咖啡馆，来到海边或河边的护栏旁，看着夕阳沉入地平线。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Silhouette shot of @otkdavhcb.harustrate and @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow leaning against a railing overlooking the ocean/river. The sun is a giant orange orb sinking below the horizon. The water reflects the fiery sky. The mood is serene and romantic. Wide cinematic aspect ratio.\n*   **Camera:** Wide Shot (全景), 缓慢平移 (Slow Pan)\n*   **中文旁白:** “想和你一起，虚度这漫长的黄昏。”\n\n---\n\n# 📼 Segment 3 (00:30 - 00:45)\n**本段主题：心动与凝视 (夜晚 8:00 PM)**\n**本段总时长：15.0秒**\n\n### Shot 8\n*   **Duration:** 4.5 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 城市夜景天台，背景是绚烂的霓虹灯海。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Night scene on a rooftop terrace. The background is a bustling metropolis with vibrant neon lights (cyberpunk vibes but romantic). @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow is looking at the view, the city lights reflecting in her eyes. She looks mesmerized. Cool blue and pink lighting tones.\n*   **Camera:** Medium Close-up (中特写), 环绕拍摄 (Orbital shot)\n*   **中文旁白:** “城市的灯火再亮，也不及你眼中的星光。”\n\n### Shot 9\n*   **Duration:** 5.5 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** Haru 并没有看风景，而是深情地注视着 Sayuri 的侧脸。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Side profile of @otkdavhcb.harustrate looking deeply at @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow, ignoring the spectacular view behind them. He gently tucks a strand of hair behind her ear. The lighting is soft and intimate, emphasizing his affectionate expression. Photorealistic, emotional depth.\n*   **Camera:** Close-up (特写), 极慢动作 (Slow Motion)\n*   **中文旁白:** “你看着风景，而我，只看着你。”\n\n### Shot 10\n*   **Duration:** 5.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** Sayuri 转过头发现 Haru 在看她，害羞地低头笑了。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow turns her head to face @otkdavhcb.harustrate. She realizes he was staring at her, blushes slightly, and looks down with a shy, happy smile. City bokeh lights twinkle in the background. Soft focus, dreamy aesthetic.\n*   **Camera:** Frontal shot (正面镜头), 柔光滤镜感\n*   **中文旁白:** “这一刻的悸动，我将永远收藏。”\n\n---\n\n# 📼 Segment 4 (00:45 - 01:00)\n**本段主题：承诺与定格 (深夜 10:00 PM)**\n**本段总时长：15.0秒**\n\n### Shot 11\n*   **Duration:** 4.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 两人在空无一人的街道奔跑、嬉闹，充满青春活力。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    @otkdavhcb.harustrate and @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow running playfully down an empty illuminated street at night. They are holding hands, pulling each other forward. Laughter is implied. Motion blur on the background to show speed and energy. Cinematic street photography style.\n*   **Camera:** Low angle (低角度), 跟随奔跑 (Tracking run)\n*   **中文旁白:** “和你在一起，每一秒都是自由的。”\n\n### Shot 12\n*   **Duration:** 4.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 两人停下脚步，在路灯下拥抱。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Under a solitary street lamp, mist swirling around. @otkdavhcb.harustrate and @gbtgqfohr.sayurisnow stop running and embrace tightly. The light creates a spotlight effect on them, isolating them from the darkness. High emotional impact.\n*   **Camera:** Medium Shot (中景), 缓慢拉远 (Slow Zoom Out)\n*   **中文旁白:** “如果时间能停下，就停在这个拥抱里吧。”\n\n### Shot 13\n*   **Duration:** 7.0 sec\n*   **Scene (简述):** 结尾画面，两人背影渐行渐远，画面慢慢黑屏。\n*   **Sora Prompt (详细):**\n    Back view of the couple walking away from the camera into the deep night city depth. They are leaning on each other. The camera stays static as they get smaller. Text overlay appears subtly: \"To be continued\". Fade to black. Melancholic yet hopeful atmosphere.\n*   **Camera:** Static Wide Shot (固定全景), 逐渐失焦 (Fade to blur)\n*   **中文旁白:** “今晚的月色真美。晚安，我的爱人。”"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 12, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [536.509033203125, 436.1060791015625], "pos": [-16.22035789489746, 2710.099609375], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#353", "groupcolor": "#8A8", "color": "#232"}}, "order": 33}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["", "output_text"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 13, "label": "text", "t